    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Not formally, but I’ve tried quick online calculators for quick checks (e.g., solving linear equations). They’re handy for verifying work, though I avoid relying on them too much—I want to understand core concepts myself. AI might be more useful in practice, like with coding assistants, but for pure math proofs, trust is harder.",
